          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "1. CSP 并发模型"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "1-csp-并发模型"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "CSP（Communicating Sequential Processes）模型是 1970 年代 Tony Hoare 提出的并发理论，描述两个独立的并发实体通过共享的 channel（管道）进行通信的并发模型。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "1.1 核心思想"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "11-核心思想"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "table",
        "align": [
          null,
          null
        ],
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "Process"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "独立的并发实体（如 goroutine）"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "Channel"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "第一类对象，用于进程间消息传递"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "关注点"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "不关注是谁在发送消息，只关注用的是哪个 channel"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "关键哲学：Don't communicate by sharing memory; share memory by communicating（不要通过共享内存来通信，而要通过通信来共享内存）"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
