          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "5.1 N:1 模型（多对一）"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "51-n1-模型多对一"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "mermaid",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "graph TB\n    subgraph US[\"用户态 (User Space)\"]\n        G1[User Thread 1]\n        G2[User Thread 2]\n        G3[User Thread 3]\n    end\n    subgraph KS[\"内核态 (Kernel)\"]\n        LWP[调度实体 LWP<br/>唯一内核线程]\n    end\n    G1 --> LWP\n    G2 --> LWP\n    G3 --> LWP\n    LWP -.-> Kernel[Kernel]"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "特点：多个用户线程跑在一个内核线程上。无法利用多核；某用户线程阻塞会卡住所有。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "5.2 1:1 模型（一一对应）"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "52-11-模型一一对应"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "mermaid",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "graph TB\n    subgraph US[\"用户态\"]\n        G1[User Thread 1]\n        G2[User Thread 2]\n    end\n    subgraph KS[\"内核态\"]\n        K1[Kernel Thread 1]\n        K2[Kernel Thread 2]\n    end\n    G1 <--> K1\n    G2 <--> K2"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "特点：Java 现在的模型。利用多核；但创建/切换成本高，线程数受限。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "5.3 M:N 模型（多对多，Go 选用）"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "53-mn-模型多对多go-选用"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "mermaid",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "graph LR\n    subgraph UserT[\"用户线程 T\"]\n        T1(T1)\n        T2(T2)\n        T3(T3)\n        T4(T4)\n    end\n    subgraph K[Scheduler]\n        C{\"中心调度\"}\n    end\n    subgraph Kt[\"内核线程 K\"]\n        K1((K1))\n        K2((K2))\n        K3((K3))\n    end\n    T1 --> C\n    T2 --> C\n    T3 --> C\n    T4 --> C\n    C --> K1\n    C --> K2\n    C --> K3"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "特点：Go 的 GMP 模型基础，结合 N:1 的轻量 + 1:1 的多核优势。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
