      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Go 实现了语言层面的调度器，通过 M:N 线程模型达到高效率。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "6.1 三个核心角色"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "61-三个核心角色"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "table",
        "align": [
          null,
          null,
          null
        ],
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "G"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "Goroutine"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "待执行的 goroutine，包含栈空间"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "M"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "Machine"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "内核线程，实际执行单元"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "P"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "Processor"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "调度协调器，协调 M 和 G 的执行"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "关键规则：内核线程必须拿到 P 才能调度 goroutine。通常通过限定 P 的数量控制并发度（默认 = CPU 核数）。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "6.2 调度示意"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "62-调度示意"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "mermaid",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "graph TB\n    M[\"M<br/>(Machine: 内核线程)\"]\n    P[\"P<br/>(Processor: 调度协调器)\"]\n    G[\"G<br/>(当前执行的 goroutine)\"]\n    subgraph Q[\"本地执行队列 (P 持有)\"]\n        G1((G1))\n        G2((G2))\n        G3((G3 灰色: 挂起中))\n        G4((G4 灰色: 挂起中))\n    end\n    M --> P\n    P --> G\n    P --> G1\n    G1 --- G2\n    G2 --- G3\n    G3 --- G4"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "说明："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "P 通过 epoll 监听网络 I/O"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "灰色 Gn 是已挂起的 goroutine（在等待 I/O）"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "当 P 通过 epoll 发现对应 fd 就绪时，会重新调度对应的挂起 goroutine"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "6.3 Work Stealing（工作窃取）算法"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "63-work-stealing工作窃取算法"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "为保证调度公平性，Go 调度器引入了 work stealing："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": true,
        "start": 1,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "P 先处理自己的本地执行队列\n↓"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "队列空后，到全局执行队列偷 G\n↓"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "全局队列也空，再到其他 P 的队列抢 G"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "避免部分 P 饥饿 + 充分利用多核。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "7. 总结"
